[
  {
    "entryID": 1,
    "actorID": 73,
    "text": "「有事？」",
    "Sequence": "",
    "links": [
      2,
      3
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 2,
    "actorID": 0,
    "text": "「童師傅，我想請您指點一二。」",
    "Sequence": "",
    "Description": "選項一：請求切磋",
    "links": [
      4
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 3,
    "actorID": 0,
    "text": "「沒事，我只是路過。」",
    "Sequence": "",
    "Description": "選項二：路過",
    "links": [
      100
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 4,
    "actorID": 73,
    "text": "「哦？還想再來？可以。」",
    "Sequence": "SetPortrait(73,pic=normal);",
    "links": [
      5
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 5,
    "actorID": 73,
    "text": "「不過，我這身槍法來得不易。要我單獨餵招、指點你的破綻，也得耗費心神。收你一百五十錢的指點錢，不過分吧？」",
    "Sequence": "",
    "links": [
      6
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 6,
    "actorID": "MC8",
    "text": "「一百五十錢？！這也太貴了！真過分！」",
    "Sequence": "SetPortrait(MC8,pic=surprise);EnableCharacterExpression(1,MC8_Shock);",
    "links": [
      7,
      8
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 7,
    "actorID": 0,
    "text": "「請童師傅務必指點！」",
    "Sequence": "",
    "Description": "選項一：確認付費切磋",
    "links": [
      9
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 8,
    "actorID": 0,
    "text": "「我再考慮一下…」",
    "Sequence": "",
    "Description": "選項二：取消切磋",
    "links": [
      200
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 9,
    "actorID": 0,
    "text": "",
    "Sequence": "",
    "Description": "條件分歧點：檢查玩家金錢與切磋次數",
    "links": [
      10,
      30,
      40
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 10,
    "actorID": 73,
    "text": "「錢不夠啊，朋友。等你湊夠了再來吧。闖蕩江湖，沒錢寸步難行，這也是江湖上的一課。」",
    "Sequence": "DisableCharacterExpression(1);SetPortrait(73,pic=dislike);",
    "Description": "分支：金錢不足",
    "links": [
      11
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 11,
    "actorID": "MC8",
    "text": "「我就說嘛！表哥，我們還是先去賺錢吧！」",
    "Sequence": "SetPortrait(MC8,pic=normal);",
    "links": [
      12
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 12,
    "actorID": "MC1",
    "text": "「呃…童師傅，我們稍後再來…」",
    "Sequence": "SetPortrait(MC1,pic=Shy);",
    "links": []
  },
  {
    "entryID": 30,
    "actorID": 73,
    "text": "「今日的指點已經夠了。貪多嚼不爛。把你學到的東西好生琢磨透徹，比什麼都重要。去吧。」",
    "Sequence": "DisableCharacterExpression(1);SetPortrait(73,pic=normal);",
    "Description": "分支：指導結束（已達4次）",
    "links": [
      31
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 31,
    "actorID": "MC1",
    "text": "「童師傅高義，今日之恩，晚輩銘記在心！」",
    "Sequence": "SetPortrait(MC1,pic=serious);",
    "links": []
  },
  {
    "entryID": 40,
    "actorID": "MC8",
    "text": "「嗚…一百五十錢…表哥，你可一定要學到東西啊！」",
    "Sequence": "DisableCharacterExpression(1);ModifyData(Player,Money,-150);SetPortrait(MC8,pic=pain);",
    "Description": "分支：切磋環節",
    "links": [
      41
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 41,
    "actorID": 73,
    "text": "「很好，有膽色。看好了，我的槍只會出一次！」",
    "Sequence": "SetPortrait(73,pic=serious);",
    "links": [
      42
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 42,
    "actorID": 2,
    "text": "[panel=6]＊（你將一百五十錢交給了童淵。童淵身形一晃，人已不在原處，下一刻，凌厲的槍風已撲面而來！你使出渾身解數，勉強擋住了這一擊。）＊",
    "Sequence": "PlayAnimation(Spar);ModifyData(Game,TongYuan_Spar_Count,+1);",
    "Description": "條件分歧點：根據切磋次數跳轉",
    "links": [
      50,
      60,
      70,
      80
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 50,
    "actorID": 73,
    "text": "「哼，架勢鬆散，破綻百出。不過，倒是比我想像的要禁得起打一點。記住方才那一下，回去多練練基本功。」",
    "Sequence": "SetPortrait(73,pic=normal);",
    "Description": "第一次切磋後",
    "links": [
      51
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 51,
    "actorID": "MC1",
    "text": "「多謝童師傅指點，我會的！」",
    "Sequence": "SetPortrait(MC1,pic=serious);",
    "links": [
      52
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 52,
    "actorID": 2,
    "text": "[panel=6]＊（經過童淵的指點，你的身法似乎更為靈活了。）＊",
    "Sequence": "ModifyData(AbilityExp,MC1,Ability_DEX,10);",
    "links": []
  },
  {
    "entryID": 60,
    "actorID": 73,
    "text": "「哦？有點長進。這次懂得避其鋒芒了。但光會躲可成不了氣候。武藝，在於變化運用，你還差得遠呢。」",
    "Sequence": "SetPortrait(73,pic=normal);",
    "Description": "第二次切磋後",
    "links": [
      61
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 61,
    "actorID": "MC1",
    "text": "「變化與應用…我明白了。」",
    "Sequence": "SetPortrait(MC1,pic=Meditate);",
    "links": [
      62
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 62,
    "actorID": 2,
    "text": "[panel=6]＊（你對招式的應用有了新的領悟。）＊",
    "Sequence": "ModifyData(AbilityExp,MC1,Ability_DEX,10);",
    "links": []
  },
  {
    "entryID": 70,
    "actorID": 73,
    "text": "「你的技巧已有雛形，但力量卻跟不上。槍是剛猛的兵器，沒有足夠的氣力，再精妙的招式也只是花架子。看來得先打熬你的筋骨氣力。」",
    "Sequence": "SetPortrait(73,pic=normal);",
    "Description": "第三次切磋後",
    "links": [
      71
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 71,
    "actorID": "MC8",
    "text": "「表哥加油！錢不能白花呀！」",
    "Sequence": "SetPortrait(MC8,pic=happy);",
    "links": [
      72
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 72,
    "actorID": 2,
    "text": "[panel=6]＊（在童淵的緊逼之下，你只覺自己的氣力長進了些。）＊",
    "Sequence": "ModifyData(AbilityExp,MC1,Ability_STR,10);",
    "links": []
  },
  {
    "entryID": 80,
    "actorID": 73,
    "text": "「不錯。你的氣力沉穩了不少，出招也更有章法了。今日的指點就到此為止。你已不再是當初的門外漢，接下來的路，需要你自己去走了。」",
    "Sequence": "SetPortrait(73,pic=proud);",
    "Description": "第四次切磋後",
    "links": [
      81
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 81,
    "actorID": "MC1",
    "text": "「多謝童師傅栽培！」",
    "Sequence": "SetPortrait(MC1,pic=proud);",
    "links": [
      82
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 82,
    "actorID": "MC8",
    "text": "「太好了表哥！看來這錢花得值！」",
    "Sequence": "SetPortrait(MC8,pic=happy);",
    "links": [
      83
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 83,
    "actorID": 2,
    "text": "[panel=6]＊（你的根基似乎更加穩固了。）＊",
    "Sequence": "ModifyData(AbilityExp,MC1,Ability_STR,10);",
    "links": []
  },
  {
    "entryID": 100,
    "actorID": 73,
    "text": "「嗯。」",
    "Sequence": "",
    "links": []
  },
  {
    "entryID": 200,
    "actorID": 73,
    "text": "「想清楚再來。」",
    "Sequence": "DisableCharacterExpression(1);",
    "links": [
      201
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 201,
    "actorID": "MC8",
    "text": "「太好了，表哥總算沒有亂花錢…」",
    "Sequence": "SetPortrait(MC8,pic=happy);",
    "links": []
  },
  {
    "entryID": 300,
    "actorID": 2,
    "text": "[panel=6]＊（你來到河邊，見水波盪漾，偶有魚兒躍出水面。此地似乎是個不錯的釣點。）＊",
    "Sequence": "",
    "links": [
      301
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 301,
    "actorID": "MC1",
    "text": "「嗯，這河水平緩，倒也適合垂釣。說不定能釣上幾尾肥魚，打打牙祭。」",
    "Sequence": "SetPortrait(MC1,pic=Meditate);",
    "links": [
      302
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 302,
    "actorID": "MC8",
    "text": "「釣魚？如果能釣到大魚拿去賣錢就好了！表哥，我們的盤纏可不多了！」",
    "Sequence": "SetPortrait(MC8,pic=expect);",
    "links": [
      303,
      304
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 303,
    "actorID": 0,
    "text": "「試試手氣，釣幾尾魚上來。」",
    "Sequence": "",
    "Description": "選項一：釣魚",
    "links": [
      305
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 304,
    "actorID": 0,
    "text": "「還是先辦正事要緊。」",
    "Sequence": "",
    "Description": "選項二：離開",
    "links": []
  },
  {
    "entryID": 305,
    "actorID": 2,
    "text": "[panel=6]＊（突然，釣竿猛地一沉，一股巨大的力道傳來！你急忙穩住身形，與水下的東西一番角力，終於將其拉出水面——竟是一個渾身翠綠、頭頂禿禿的古怪生物！）＊",
    "Sequence": "",
    "links": [
      306
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 306,
    "actorID": 101,
    "text": "「豈有此理！竟敢用這等劣質蚯蚓打擾本大爺清修！看招！」",
    "Sequence": "",
    "links": [
      307
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 307,
    "actorID": "MC8",
    "text": "「哇啊！是、這是什麼怪物啊！怪噁心的！」",
    "Sequence": "SetPortrait(MC8,pic=surprise);EnableCharacterExpression(1,MC8_Shock);",
    "links": [
      308
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 308,
    "actorID": "MC1",
    "text": "「呔！何方妖物，竟敢在此作祟！看我伏虎拳！」",
    "Sequence": "DisableCharacterExpression(1);SetPortrait(MC1,pic=proud);",
    "links": [
      309
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 309,
    "actorID": 0,
    "text": "",
    "Sequence": "BeginCombat(Kappa_Battle);",
    "Description": "觸發戰鬥：河童",
    "links": [
      320,
      330
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 320,
    "actorID": 101,
    "text": "「嗚…好漢饒命！是小的有眼不識泰山！這些亮晶晶的寶貝都孝敬給您，只求好漢饒我一命！」",
    "Sequence": "",
    "Description": "分支：戰鬥勝利",
    "links": [
      321
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 321,
    "actorID": 2,
    "text": "[panel=6]＊（妖怪從它腰間的小布袋裡，倒出了一堆亮閃閃的銅錢。）＊",
    "Sequence": "ModifyData(Player,Money,+200);",
    "links": [
      322
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 322,
    "actorID": "MC8",
    "text": "「哇！如果多來幾隻這種怪物那我們不就發財了！」",
    "Sequence": "SetPortrait(MC8,pic=expect);",
    "links": [
      323
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 323,
    "actorID": 101,
    "text": "「…小小年紀卻說出這麼恐怖的話！」",
    "Sequence": "",
    "links": [
      324
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 324,
    "actorID": "MC1",
    "text": "「哼，你這小妖這次就放過你，下次小心點吧。」",
    "Sequence": "SetPortrait(MC1,pic=normal);",
    "links": [
      325
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 325,
    "actorID": 2,
    "text": "[panel=6]＊（話剛說完，這妖怪一溜煙跳回河裡，消失不見了。）＊",
    "Sequence": "",
    "links": []
  },
  {
    "entryID": 330,
    "actorID": 101,
    "text": "「哼，就這點三腳貓功夫，也敢學人來這條河釣魚？真是笑掉本大爺的大牙！」",
    "Sequence": "",
    "Description": "分支：戰鬥失敗",
    "links": [
      331
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 331,
    "actorID": 101,
    "text": "「小子，這河邊可不太平，下次眼睛放亮點，別什麼都敢惹！」",
    "Sequence": "",
    "links": [
      332
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 332,
    "actorID": 2,
    "text": "[panel=6]＊（妖怪嘲笑一番後，噗通一聲跳回河裡，消失不見了。）＊",
    "Sequence": "",
    "links": [
      333
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 333,
    "actorID": "MC8",
    "text": "「表哥你沒事吧？這妖怪好兇…」",
    "Sequence": "SetPortrait(MC8,pic=worried);",
    "links": [
      334
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 334,
    "actorID": "MC1",
    "text": "「我…我只是一時大意！下次定不饒它！」",
    "Sequence": "SetPortrait(MC1,pic=anger);",
    "links": []
  },
  {
    "entryID": 400,
    "actorID": 2,
    "text": "[panel=6]＊（你再次踏入這間廢棄的屋子，不知為何，心中總覺得有些異樣。就在此時，懷中那枚赫連娜娜給你的「星淚石」突然微微發燙，似與屋內的某樣東西遙相呼應。）＊",
    "Sequence": "",
    "links": [
      401
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 401,
    "actorID": "MC1",
    "text": "「嗯？這石頭…怎麼回事？」",
    "Sequence": "SetPortrait(MC1,pic=surprise);",
    "links": [
      402
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 402,
    "actorID": "MC8",
    "text": "「表哥，這不是那個赫連姑娘給你的石頭嗎？它怎麼在發光發熱？」",
    "Sequence": "SetPortrait(MC8,pic=expect);",
    "links": [
      403
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 403,
    "actorID": 2,
    "text": "[panel=6]＊（你話音未落，手中的「星淚石」光芒大作，一股清涼的氣息霎時湧入你的腦海！）＊",
    "Sequence": "PlayAnimation(Vision);",
    "links": [
      404
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 404,
    "actorID": 2,
    "text": "[panel=6]＊（你的眼前景象變換，看到了一幕前所未見的異象。一名穿著奇異服飾的女子，正悲傷地佇立在河邊，手中緊握著一枚同樣發光的石頭。她的聲音直接在你的腦中響起，空靈而絕望。）＊",
    "Sequence": "",
    "Description": "閃回/上古情境",
    "links": [
      405
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 405,
    "actorID": 999,
    "text": "「星位盡失，瓊核已碎…歸期…無望矣…」",
    "Sequence": "",
    "links": [
      406
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 406,
    "actorID": 2,
    "text": "[panel=6]＊（畫面一轉，你看到巨大的陰影從天而降，撞向遠處的山脈，霎時天搖地動。女子驚恐地抬起頭，淚水滑落。最終，畫面隨著她絕望的眼神一同歸於黑暗。）＊",
    "Sequence": "",
    "links": [
      407
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 407,
    "actorID": "MC1",
    "text": "「呃啊…！」",
    "Sequence": "SetPortrait(MC1,pic=surprise);EnableCharacterExpression(0,MC1_Shock);",
    "Description": "回到現實",
    "links": [
      408
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 408,
    "actorID": "MC8",
    "text": "「表哥！你到底怎麼了？你剛剛突然發呆，嚇死我了！」",
    "Sequence": "SetPortrait(MC8,pic=worried);EnableCharacterExpression(1,MC8_Nervous_2);",
    "links": [
      409
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 409,
    "actorID": "MC1",
    "text": "「我…我好像…看到了一些…很久很久以前的舊事…」",
    "Sequence": "DisableCharacterExpression(1);SetPortrait(MC1,pic=mindpain);",
    "links": [
      410
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 410,
    "actorID": 2,
    "text": "[panel=6]＊（你攤開手掌，那枚「星淚石」表面的光芒已經完全黯淡，變成了一塊普通的漂亮石頭。）＊",
    "Sequence": "DisableCharacterExpression(0);ModifyData(Inventory,RemoveItem,StarTearStone,1);ModifyData(Inventory,AddItem,FadedTearstone,1);",
    "links": [
      411
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 411,
    "actorID": 2,
    "text": "[panel=6]＊（巨大的陰影…歸期無望…赫連娜娜所追尋的秘密，似乎遠比想像的更加驚人。這座看似平凡的村莊，地下究竟隱藏著什麼？）＊",
    "Sequence": "ModifyData(AbilityExp,MC1,Ability_INT,15);",
    "links": [
      412
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 412,
    "actorID": 2,
    "text": "[panel=6]＊（你窺見了淚石中的舊事，對此地的秘密又摸清了幾分。）＊",
    "Sequence": "",
    "links": []
  }
]
